Suggests: postgresql (>= 17),
          postgresql-17-pgvector | postgresql-pgvector
Description: MultiGPT - local multi-AI chat system for the family
 Django web application (served by gunicorn) to chat with several AI
 providers, shipped as a self-contained virtualenv in
 /usr/share/python/multi-gpt. gunicorn listens on localhost only; the
 package ships an nginx site (/etc/nginx/sites-available/multi-gpt) that
 terminates TLS in front of it. Needs PostgreSQL with the pgvector
 extension (local or remote). Administration via mgpt-ctl.
